<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ValuJet Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ValuJet Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co Inc analyst Steve Lewins reiterated its neutral rating on ValuJet Inc and warned that the company may again face default of its financial covenants.</p>
<p>-- said expects ValuJet to post a fourth quarter loss of $0.30 a share.</p>
<p>-- said if ValuJet is in default of its bank covenants, its lead lenders, Bank of Montreal and NationsBank will likely take a tougher stance. But Gruntal expects the banks will allow ValuJet to remain aloft.</p>
<p>-- ValuJet closed at 6-17/32, down 1/32.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
